<Arluin dangles a colorful, elaborately decorated scroll in front of you.>

It is an invitation. To a party. A party which all of the Suramar nobility will be attending.

Not least on the guest list is Grand Magistrix Elisande herself.

If you are thinking what I am thinking, then you would agree that Ly'leth needs to know about this.

Immediately. 
